{"id":"0e157dc774509959","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ville-selection.md","title":"Ville 的可数选择族定理","display":"thm-ville-selection — Ville 的可数选择族定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ville-selection","aliases":["43-thm-ville-selection"],"display":"thm-ville-selection — Ville 的可数选择族定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-selection-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.1 Theorem 9.3.1，印刷173–177，PDF193–197","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ville-selection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ville-selection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ville-selection — Ville 的可数选择族定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5cac6460c6fc0b98\" href=\"?note=5cac6460c6fc0b98\" title=\"43-df-selection-rule\">43-df-selection-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.1 Theorem 9.3.1，印刷173–177，PDF193–197"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是总选择函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(r:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的可数集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stochastic}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stochastic}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5cac6460c6fc0b98\" href=\"?note=5cac6460c6fc0b98\" title=\"43-df-selection-rule\">43-df-selection-rule</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)=\\frac12\\land\\forall r\\in E\\;\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)\\le\\frac n2\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)=\\frac12\\land\\forall r\\in E\\;\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)\\le\\frac n2\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任何可数族都可通过，而从原点开始的偏差始终不为正。源书强调这违背典型随机游走的振荡，展示选择频率测试的局限。E不要求有效枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.1 Theorem 9.3.1，印刷173–177，PDF193–197。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-selection-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5cac6460c6fc0b98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-selection-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-selection-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5cac6460c6fc0b98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $E$ 是总选择函数 $r:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 的可数集合，$\\operatorname{Stochastic}$ 见 [[43-df-selection-rule]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"r:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stochastic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i<n}X(i)=\\frac12\\land\\forall r\\in E\\;\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\sum_{i<n}X(i)\\le\\frac n2\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1290,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ville-selection]] — Ville 的可数选择族定理"}],"outgoing":["5cac6460c6fc0b98"]}